# Tailoring & LLM Rules

- LLM temperature **≤ 0.1**; output must match strict JSON schema
- Run `validate_llm_output()` before persisting any LLM result
- On validation failure, fall back to `deterministic.build_reports()`
- Forbidden in LLM output: new skills, employers, dates, invented metrics
- STAR methodology: reorder existing bullets only
